sequenceDiagram
    participant USB as USB / kernel
    participant Service as usb-monitor
    participant File as Playlist file
    participant Reader as UsbPlaylistReader
    participant Player as PlayerController / QML
    USB->>Service: Block-device event through udev
    Service->>Service: Mount FAT32 read-only at /media/usb0
    Service->>Service: Scan media files
    Service->>File: Publish playlist using atomic replacement
    Reader->>File: Read on watch notification or fallback poll
    Reader->>Reader: Validate mount and paths
    Reader->>Player: Update model, select first item
    Note over Reader,Player: Default selection does not request playback
    Player->>USB: Read media after a Play request
    par Service cleanup on removal
        USB->>Service: Active USB removed
        Service->>Service: Cancel scan
        Service->>File: Clear playlist
        Service->>Service: Release mount and active session
    and Independent application mount check
        Reader->>Reader: Detect mount loss
        Reader->>Player: Signal disconnect, clear model
        Player->>Player: Stop playback and update UI
    end
